// Gym-style environment API for the LiveSched simulator.
//
// One Reset starts an episode (a synthetic week of one scenario); each Step
// applies an action (HCDN's knobs for the next control interval), advances
// the simulator by step_seconds and returns the observation and reward. The
// final Close returns the episode's full metrics, including the true
// 95th-percentile-billing cost that per-step rewards only approximate.

